permissions-help = The owner is the account that owns the file; group members use the group permissions, and others are all remaining accounts. For directories, read lists names, write creates and removes entries, and execute allows entering. [-] means mixed or not yet scanned. Use Left/Right to select and Space to toggle; Enter moves to the next field and confirms from the last. Recursive changes use separate file and directory permissions.
